1
00:00:14,516 --> 00:00:15,600
Perino:
(Sussurrando)
Já terminou?

2
00:00:15,683 --> 00:00:17,101
Você ainda tem tempo
para revisar as respostas

3
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:18,102
